  {
   "id": "the-night-of-the-scissors-199297@major-2022-08-31",
   "gameId": "the-night-of-the-scissors-199297",
   "displayName": "Multi-language update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-08-31T00:43:46.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We're proud to present you the patch 1.2.0 for The Night of the Scissors, which includes one of the most demanded features, language localization.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "List of official translations",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Spanish",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Portuguese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "German",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "French",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Finnish",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added localization support",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added auto detect language feature (if language is available, based on your system language)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added language selector to the settings screen",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added custom localization support",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Non official translations/Custom localization",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "One thing to point out, is that there's also support for non-official translations, if your language isn't available for the game, you can be the first to add the translation!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Under the \"/The Night of the Scissors_Data/StreamingAssets/Translations\" directory you will find easy to follow instructions in order to add your own custom translation by editing a file.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Community",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "One minor thing I'd like to share is the creation of a Discord server for The Night of the Scissors and every game published by selewi. Join us and say hello!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
